{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "JQ2LAV5P4ZVUVG7S4FSAAYQBBT5WUH5W",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "090056008",
    "title": "資料保管室調査隊",
    "enTitle": "The Archive Investigation Squad",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "忍び込み常習ウマ娘",
            "enName": "Serial Trespasser Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "わぷぷっ！　上から鳥の羽根が！？\nちょ、なにこれ、全然取れないんだけど！",
            "enText": "Wh-<i> kblfpfbt! </i>Where'd these feathers come from!? \nWait, what the— I can't get this crap off!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 214,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 282,
                    "pathId": -659536130674491814
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -143678850387966091
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8290950250592529836,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "やけ食いウマ娘",
            "enName": "Stress Eater Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "えっ、なにコレ！　どこを、踏んでも、音が、音がっ！\nおかしいでしょ～～～～！？",
            "enText": "Wait, what is this!? No matter! Where I step! It makes! Noise! \nWhat the heeeeeck!?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 271,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 125,
                    "pathId": 4780513039921287698
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3155650958569056299
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7190975731383797819,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンコウウインディ",
            "enName": "Shinko Windy",
            "jpText": "やっぱりな……すごいワナだぞって、言いまくったからな。\nワルなら絶対無視できないと思ってたぞ！",
            "enText": "I knew it… If I bragged about how cool my traps are, \nno bad guy would be able to help themselves!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 277,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 136,
                    "pathId": -4154031717073092687
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 172,
                    "pathId": 466729759960956737
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -31402825422320464,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンコウウインディ",
            "enName": "Shinko Windy",
            "jpText": "くっくっく、挨拶は鳥の羽根地獄なのだ！！\nくっついて取れなくて、鬱陶しいだろ～！",
            "enText": "Heh heh heh! Enjoying your stay in sticky feather heck!? \nCan't get them off, now can you!? Bet it really ticks you off!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 242,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 164,
                    "pathId": -8409593418529788154
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 138,
                    "pathId": -620494027182863978
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2859361537201328402,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "戦績表のウマ娘",
            "enName": "Horsegirl from the Result Sheet",
            "jpText": "見るからに怪しげな紐だね。\nふっ、見え見えなんだ――冷たっ！　水鉄砲の罠！？",
            "enText": "Oh, wow, a suspicious looking string. \nThat's the most obvious trap I've eve—— <i>COLD! </i>\nWas that a water gun!?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 226,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 328,
                    "pathId": -2247766752618935060
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 157,
                    "pathId": 7993506532082238237
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6303631058517399795,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンコウウインディ",
            "enName": "Shinko Windy",
            "jpText": "甘いっ！　フェイクくらい当然なのだ！\nふはははははは！　ざまぁないのだ、侵入者どもめ！",
            "enText": "You're so naive! Obviously I set some fakes! \nMuahahahahaha! You intruders look so ridiculous!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 228,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 208,
                    "pathId": 8124349049258834212
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 4592087647688065610
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -611366067733403029,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンコウウインディ",
            "enName": "Shinko Windy",
            "jpText": "ワルの考えはお見通し、あおられたら、ワルは黙ってられないのだ！\n本当にチョロかったのだ～♪",
            "enText": "I know exactly how you bad guys think! All I had to do was \ntease you a little bit, and you'd come running! \nYou guys were so easy to bait ♪",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 234,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 281,
                    "pathId": 2661552873683909343
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 36,
                    "pathId": 1228315901100169324
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1895800238271369579,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "忍び込み常習ウマ娘",
            "enName": "Serial Trespasser Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "ぐ……たいした自信だったしさ！\nそりゃあ試して、突破したくなるだろ！",
            "enText": "Ngh… You were talking such a big game back there! \nOf course I'd wanna try and take you down a peg!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 193,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 268,
                    "pathId": -1038941675988977432
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 291,
                    "pathId": 5087607266964623132
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1169747082823779368,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンコウウインディ",
            "enName": "Shinko Windy",
            "jpText": "お前らがワルらしいおかげで、侵入者大集合だな！\n作戦大成功なのだ！",
            "enText": "Thanks to you guys acting so bad, I got all the intruders \nin one place! Looks like my plan was a huge success!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 215,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 68,
                    "pathId": 6415313625263572854
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 7703090993095565553
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6997280833510472883,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サムソンビッグ",
            "enName": "Samson Big",
            "jpText": "さてさて、本題はここから！\nみんなには資料保管室に忍び込むのをやめてほしいんだ！",
            "enText": "Now that you're here, let's get down to business! \nWe want you all to stop sneaking into the archive room!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 210,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 125,
                    "pathId": -1029454161556889855
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 36,
                    "pathId": -2819666259584978252
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 185,
                    "pathId": 4143472213755011404
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 147,
                    "pathId": -6679308756842724479
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2102162872618109672,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "戦績表のウマ娘",
            "enName": "Horsegirl from the Result Sheet",
            "jpText": "って、結局風紀委員の罠じゃんか！\nアタシたちを集めて、風紀委員に突き出そうと――！",
            "enText": "Dammit, so you really are with the Disciplinary Committee! \nYou round us all up and hand us over to them, is that it!?",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 191,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 280,
                    "pathId": 7178456108858895037
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 351,
                    "pathId": -8846231085268118697
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 309,
                    "pathId": 4412164705048447989
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -4943764341202174988
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6127224855870085987,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "壁の落書きのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Graffiti Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "待って！　それは違うと思うよ。\nだって……ウララさんが、付箋に書いてたんだ。",
            "enText": "Wait! I don't think that's right. \nI mean… That's not what Urara-san said in her notes.",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 191,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 9,
                    "pathId": 2035595958100158772
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": -2124280800986996367
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 9,
                    "pathId": -6672263173831514703
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 252,
                    "pathId": -6027197829781600897
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7490085895375639742,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "！　もしかして……“ペースよみ”さん！？\nわあっ、来てくれたんだ！　うれしいな！",
            "enText": "! Wait, are you… \"Miss Pace-Blind\"!? \nWhoa, you really came! Yippee!",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 201,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 90,
                    "pathId": -7816117329029159840
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8220428251156888116,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "壁の落書きのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Graffiti Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "うん。あんなに熱烈なメッセージをもらったら、ね。\nあなたと話をしてみたいと思ったんだ。",
            "enText": "Yeah. I couldn't just not show up after seeing how \npassionately you were trying to reach out. \nI thought I should at least try talking to you.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 217,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 179,
                    "pathId": -5758249368984278388
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8006721078024865520,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "『逃げの子と走ったんだね！\nわたしも逃げの子と走ってね、すごく速くてびっくりしちゃった！』",
            "enText": "<i>\"You race with front runners too! \nWhen I race with front runners</i> <i>they're so fast! \nThey're so awesome!\"</i>",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 222,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": -1998673702039112521
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1673968175048718304,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "『ゲートを出たら、ビューーン！　て先にいっちゃうよね。\n速いペース？　のときは、どんどん遠くなっちゃうの！』",
            "enText": "<i>\"They go WHOOSH right out of the gate and leave me behind. \nWhen the pace is… ecks-selerated? \nThey get further and further!\"</i>",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 263,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "pathId": -6207913645124909065,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "『でも、前に走ってる子がいると楽しいよね！　追いつくぞ～って！\nちょっとずつ近づけると、と～～～ってもワクワクするんだ！』",
            "enText": "\"But I like it when they do because it's fun because I get to \nchase them! Whenever I get closer and closer I get so excited!\"",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 332,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "pathId": -8449238729282352507,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "『追いついて1着になったら、どれくらいワクワクするのかな？\nすっごく楽しみだね！　――ハルウララより』",
            "enText": "\"I wonder how excited I would be if I chased them and won? \nI can't wait to do that someday! \n——Love, Haru Urara\"",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 251,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "pathId": 7280774604038329291,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "壁の落書きのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Graffiti Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "メッセージを読んで……私たちがなぜここに来たのか、\nわかっているような気がしたんだよね。違う？",
            "enText": "When I read your messages… I got the feeling you figured out \nwhy we were coming here. Right?",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 221,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 356,
                    "pathId": -2927896887183034221
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 300,
                    "pathId": -7644566530487720553
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5819408841850497586,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンコウウインディ",
            "enName": "Shinko Windy",
            "jpText": "当然なのだ。ウインディちゃんたちも、レースを走るからな。\nトレセン学園生にとって、ここは必要な場所なのだ。",
            "enText": "Obviously. We're all racers too. \nWe know everyone at Tracen needs this place.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 264,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 135,
                    "pathId": 6616027724405889361
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -8696161645456607044
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 163,
                    "pathId": -7721855866725639828
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 7463945493869139220
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1433998278815015471,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "壁の落書きのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Graffiti Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "ほらね。だから話を聞いてみない？　私は“連敗に挫けない\nハルウララ”が、どんな提案をするのか聞いてみたくて、来たのよ。",
            "enText": "See, what'd I tell you? Let's hear 'em out. \nHaru Urara never gives up, no matter how many times she loses. \nAnd I came here 'cuz I wanna hear what she has to say.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 311,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 406,
                    "pathId": -1552417644317935972
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 159,
                    "pathId": 6650599563085737656
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 327,
                    "pathId": 4356190560294267578
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6839957162130900024,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サムソンビッグ",
            "enName": "Samson Big",
            "jpText": "あたしたちはね、みんなを捕まえたいわけじゃないよ！\n保管室の調査を頼まれてたの！",
            "enText": "We're not here because we wanna catch you! \nOur job was to investigate the archive!",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 186,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 9,
                    "pathId": 5140452179120494928
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": 7981548937601778736
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 229,
                    "pathId": 4419101409594447999
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 2476206689882578569
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 9,
                    "pathId": -479585451292273566
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 222,
                    "pathId": 8404563753981818594
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -547672834436822235
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9103571029539850493,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サムソンビッグ",
            "enName": "Samson Big",
            "jpText": "調査ってことはさ、学園側も理由を知りたかったんだよ。\nだから、交渉はできると思うな！",
            "enText": "All that means is the school wants to know why you're \ndoing this. So I think we can find a compromise!",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 222,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 90,
                    "pathId": 6995501568701059398
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8121167264894150608
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 388,
                    "pathId": 4669127450790889371
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 219,
                    "pathId": -3653076489686109155
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -14025161435415207,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビコーペガサス",
            "enName": "Biko Pegasus",
            "jpText": "忍び込みをやめてほしい、それがアタシたちの希望だ。\nみんなからの希望は？　それを聞かせてくれ！",
            "enText": "What we want is for you guys to stop sneaking in. \nSo what do you guys want? Please, tell us!",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 275,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 161,
                    "pathId": -5403856587865170097
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 36,
                    "pathId": -7972821092918327716
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 141,
                    "pathId": -8745494874208778784
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5605627333536783726
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5197492623331076596,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビコーペガサス",
            "enName": "Biko Pegasus",
            "jpText": "アタシたちがちゃんと、学園に伝えるから！",
            "enText": "I promise we'll pass it on to the school!",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": 24,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 304,
                    "pathId": -4485533117563967691
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7642395273656565788
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 171,
                    "pathId": -6982878615199704046
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8250209345552549012
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1304356463652135065,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "戦績表のウマ娘",
            "enName": "Horsegirl from the Result Sheet",
            "jpText": "……ガチで交渉しにきたんだ。予想外っつーか、\nアタシたちの目的、全部わかっててそう言われるとさ――",
            "enText": "…You seriously are just here to talk, huh? \nHonestly, I like, didn't expect that… Well, more like, the \nfact that you guys seem to really get it is——",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 293,
            "voiceIdx": 25,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 449,
                    "pathId": 5435966019353061379
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 356,
                    "pathId": 5770420641180370615
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 9,
                    "pathId": 3921757382949318151
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 206,
                    "pathId": -1029463156795159688
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 455,
                    "pathId": 2519873890893822533
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 9,
                    "pathId": 8657175473309354669
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3306975270146695258,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "忍び込み常習ウマ娘",
            "enName": "Serial Trespasser Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "ふふふっ、正直嬉しいよね。当たり散らして情けないとか、\n怒りに任せて暴れるなんて野蛮だとか、言わないんだもんな。",
            "enText": "Hahaha. Honestly? I'm glad. If you wanted to, you guys could've \ncalled us sore losers lashing out, or thugs who can't control \nour anger. But you didn't.",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 328,
            "voiceIdx": 26,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 416,
                    "pathId": -711389190700138970
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 312,
                    "pathId": 4587736015044856483
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 378,
                    "pathId": -8489226711170901820
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 7169580965663469915
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8575977678010552326,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンコウウインディ",
            "enName": "Shinko Windy",
            "jpText": "言わないのだ！\nウインディちゃんだって、負けたらガブガブするのだ！",
            "enText": "I'd never call you stuff like that! \nI mean, I get all chompy when I lose too!",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 147,
            "voiceIdx": 27,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 198,
                    "pathId": 8775902264664163415
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 140,
                    "pathId": 5099131686661926444
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 198,
                    "pathId": -3021714853189534176
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 103,
                    "pathId": 7744817085524588139
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6714416258244644105,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
