            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "うわーーーん！　たいちょー！\n見ててくれた？　ウララ、がんばったよ！",
            "enText": "Waaaahhhhh! Captain! \nDid you see? I did my bestest!",
