        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "ええ。笑顔でいつも頑張るウララさんだから、その言葉が\n彼女たちに響いたのです。貴方にしか、できないことでありますよ！",
            "enText": "I did. You're a hard worker who always runs with a smile. \nThat's why they were willing to listen to you. \nThat was something only you could have done!",
            "nextBlock": 40,
            "origClipLength": 345,
            "voiceIdx": 38,
            "pathId": 8212887905995126237,
            "blockIdx": 39
