        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "ビッグさんの諦めない強さがあったから、皆が進み続けられた！\nビコーさんの相手に寄り添うまっすぐな言葉が、誠実さを伝えた！",
            "enText": "Big-san, your perseverance let the squad keep moving forward! \nBiko-san, your kind, understanding words showed them how \nsincere you were!",
