        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "ウインディさんのワルな作戦が、解決へと道をつなげた！\n皆さんの長所を活かし、全員で力を合わせたのですね……！",
            "enText": "And Windy-san, your \"bad guy\" strategy paved the way to \nsolving this case! The four of you made full use of all your \nstrengths, and worked together as an incredible team…!",
            "nextBlock": 42,
            "origClipLength": 372,
            "voiceIdx": 40,
            "pathId": 2629091687618515823,
            "blockIdx": 41
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "本当に……本当に、皆さんは……っ、す゛み゛ま゛せ゛ん゛！\n言゛葉゛に゛な゛り゛ま゛せ゛ん゛ッ゛！！",
            "enText": "Truly… Truly, you're all… <i>\nI… I'M SORRY! \nI'M AT A LOSS FOR WORDS!!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 43,
            "origClipLength": 415,
            "voiceIdx": 41,
            "pathId": -8055748466239838330,
            "blockIdx": 42
        },
